        "Death Benefit Obligation"@en ;
    skos:definition "Indicates the accelerated death benefit rider associated with an insurance policy, which allows the policyholder to receive a portion of the death benefit prior to death under specified conditions."@en .

li:hasAgentAuthorityLimitation a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Has Agent Authority Limitation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Relates an agent to the specific limitations on their authority as defined in an insurance contract. Assigned domain=CorporateEntity, range=Right; The property specifies limitations on an agent’s authority as defined in…"@en ;
